id: constraint.never_delete_user_files
category: constraint
status: verified
date: 2026-08-24
content: NEVER delete user files, games, or applications without explicit user confirmation. Steam apps are especially protected.
notes: |
  File deletion is a destructive operation — always verify before executing
  Steam apps/games are never to be removed under any circumstances
  User data is sacred — the system should never assume it can safely delete
  When in doubt, ask the user rather than risk data loss
  This is a hard constraint, not a preference
tags: [safety, user-data, deletion, steam, protection]
